    "G4_release": "Human-oriented usability check, deployment health check, reproducible release artifacts and rollback.",
    "pass_rule": "Mark PAID_SUPERIOR only when corresponding documented usage scope demonstrably exceeds a named paid tier without material critical regressions. Never infer superiority from feature count alone."
